<UML:Comment id="7f25e52f-6049-11f0-8d7e-b32d22cd84b0">
<body>
<val>- Reading/Normalization of Arduinos Sensor Data over Serial (USB)
- Filtering/Smoothing of Data over time
- Aggregation/Sampling (intervals, average/median input data)
- Events emittance over "Event Pipe" (threshold, rate change, sustained, malfunction, combinations, start/stop of activity, baseline deviation, custom...)
- Send settings commands that come from "Command Pipe" to Arduino
- Calibration/Adjustments (Baseline checks, scaling)
- Error Handling/Report via "Event Pipe"
- Timestamping/Sync</val>
</body>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="7f25ebdf-6049-11f0-bcc7-b32d22cd84b0"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
</UML:Comment>
